# China everyday services for Surge RULE-SET
# Research supplied by user; generated: 2026-11-23 13:04 (Asia/Shanghai, UTC+8)
# Imported and structurally checked: 2026-11-23 (Asia/Singapore)
# Research observations and fetch claims below belong to the supplied report,
# not an independent repeat of every lookup. See CHINA-REVIEW.md.
# Format: Surge RULE-SET without policy names. Suggested profile policy: DIRECT.
# DIRECT is only the intended profile policy; this file does not validate every network environment.
# Domain-based, evidence-traced coverage. This is not a packet-capture verification of
# WeChat, WeChat Pay, Alipay, Taobao, Tmall, or Xianyu/Goofish clients in this run.
# Mini programs and merchant web pages may use arbitrary third-party domains not listed here.
# A fixed list cannot cover all of them.
# Shared CDN, login, risk-control, analytics, and map hosts may also serve other Tencent or
# Alibaba products; impact is noted in section comments.
# Baseline preserved from https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Kimcool/my-rules/main/china.list
# (starter dated 2026-11-23). No existing match range was narrowed or deleted.
# No PROCESS-NAME, USER-AGENT, DOMAIN-KEYWORD, or URL-REGEX rules.
# No IP-CIDR / IP-CIDR6 adopted; see comments under WeChat voice/video and CHINA-REVIEW.md.

# ----- WeChat / Weixin -----
# Login / account / safety
# weixin.qq.com covers official sites and most client hosts (mp, pay, open, long, short, dns, Channels).
# It also matches WeCom web hosts such as work.weixin.qq.com; that is existing baseline range, not a WeCom IP allowlist.
# weixin110.qq.com is a sibling under qq.com, not a subdomain of weixin.qq.com.
DOMAIN,weixin110.qq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,weixin.qq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,weixin.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wechat.com
# Community-cited WeChat HTTPDNS suffix. Not covered by weixin.qq.com.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,weixin.qq.com.cn
# Product-specific login host on shared tencent-cloud.net. Do not expand to the whole tencent-cloud.net root.
DOMAIN,apd-pcdnwxlogin.teg.tencent-cloud.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,weixinbridge.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,weixinsxy.com
# Baseline community suffixes; kept. wechatlegal.net / wechatos.net were not independently re-verified in official docs this run.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wechatlegal.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wechatos.net

# Messaging / long connection
# Most long/short/quic/finder hosts are subdomains of weixin.qq.com or wechat.com (already listed).
# WeChat web messenger official titles observed on 2026-11-23: "微信网页版" at wx2.qq.com and wx8.qq.com.
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wx.qq.com does not match wx2.qq.com or wx8.qq.com.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wx.qq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wx2.qq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wx8.qq.com
# Baseline host on a shared Tencent Mobile QQ / TBS interface. Kept; purpose not officially documented this run.
DOMAIN,wup.imtt.qq.com
# Long connections and some call paths may also connect to raw IPs (no hostname).
# No IP-CIDR is adopted: candidate ranges are dated, shared, WeCom/face-pay-specific, or over-broad. See CHINA-REVIEW.md.

# Images / video / files / Moments
# qpic.cn and qlogo.cn are shared Tencent image/avatar CDNs (WeChat Moments, official accounts, and other Tencent apps).
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,qpic.cn
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,qlogo.cn
# WeChat-specific hosts on the shared tc.qq.com media platform. Do not expand to all of tc.qq.com or qq.com.
DOMAIN,vweixinf.tc.qq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,vweixinthumb.tc.qq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wxapp.tc.qq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,up-hl.3g.qq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,yun-hl.3g.qq.com
# Baseline community host on Tencent Video (v.qq.com). Shared; kept, not expanded to v.qq.com.
DOMAIN,soup.v.qq.com

# Official accounts / Channels
# mp.weixin.qq.com, channels.weixin.qq.com and most related API hosts are covered by weixin.qq.com.
# Short-link brands such as mmbizurl.cn / wxaurl.cn / wxmpurl.cn are recorded in CHINA-REVIEW.md (community/v2fly only this run).

# Mini programs (host platform only; third-party app domains not listed)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,servicewechat.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wxs.qq.com
# WeChat cloud / mini program / devtools hosts observed on official WeChat pages (e.g. res.wxqcloud.qq.com.cn).
# WeChat-specific label on a qq.com.cn platform; do not expand to all of qq.com.cn or myqcloud.com.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wxqcloud.qq.com.cn

# Voice / video calls
# Client long-connection and some signaling hosts fall under weixin.qq.com / wechat.com.
# Community and technical write-ups say VoIP may use UDP P2P or relay to raw IPs.
# Official face-pay terminal docs also list raw long-connection IPs, but those are for face-pay devices,
# last updated 2022-11-14, and are not adopted as personal WeChat client rules.
# iot-tencent.com is a baseline suffix; official WeChat Face Pay docs (terminal allowlist) also name it.
# Shared with WeChat IoT / face-pay devices, not only the personal app.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,iot-tencent.com

# App update / download
# Tencent client download CDNs linked from the official weixin.qq.com homepage on 2026-11-23.
# Shared with other Tencent client installers; not expanded to all of qq.com.
DOMAIN,dldir1.qq.com
DOMAIN,dldir1v6.qq.com

# Maps / location (shared Tencent Map / gtimg services used by WeChat)
# Also used by other Tencent maps-enabled apps. Do not expand to all of gtimg.com or qq.com.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,map.qq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,lbs.gtimg.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wx.gtimg.com

# Baseline community host of unclear product role (xy-asia.com). Kept; see CHINA-REVIEW.md / CHINA-REVIEW.md.
DOMAIN,slife.xy-asia.com

# ----- WeChat Pay / Tenpay -----
# Pay, receive, verification, bills, and merchant API hosts under weixin.qq.com (e.g. pay.weixin.qq.com,
# api.mch.weixin.qq.com, api2.mch.weixin.qq.com, payapp.weixin.qq.com) are already covered above.
# tenpay.com is the Tenpay platform (also used by other Tencent payment surfaces).
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tenpay.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wechatpay.com
# Official WeChat Pay domain: docs and static CDN (gtimg.wechatpay.cn), merchant API backups
# (api.wechatpay.cn, api2.wechatpay.cn, payapp.wechatpay.cn, etc.), and official face-pay allowlist.
# Merchant API hosts are primarily server-side destinations; the suffix also covers client-facing Pay pages.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wechatpay.cn

# ----- Alipay -----
# Login, QR scan, pay, transfer, bills, mini programs, identity, risk control, and most API gateways
# (including render.alipay.com, openapi.alipay.com, mobilegw.alipay.com) are covered by alipay.com.
# Official service agreement (fetched 2026-11-23) defines the Alipay website as www.alipay.com and/or the client.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,alipay.com
# Official and page-referenced static / resource CDN (a/gw/i/mdn.alipayobjects.com on Alipay pages).
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,alipayobjects.com
# Community + v2fly Alipay DNS / resolution domain; official IoT allowlist pages cite *.alipaydns.com
# in search snippets, but those opendoc pages were JavaScript shells and the body was not readable this run.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,alipaydns.com
# Additional official-style Alipay product suffixes used in v2fly / Sukka / blackmatrix7 AliPay lists.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,alipay.cn
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,alipay.com.cn
# Regional Alipay products (Hong Kong, Alipay+, Macao). Shared Alipay family; not required for every
# mainland-app session, but they are product domains rather than generic Aliyun roots.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,alipay.hk
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,alipayplus.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,alipaymo.com

# ----- Taobao -----
# Official Alipay service agreement (2026-11-23) names taobao.com as Taobao. Covers login, search,
# cart, order, many APIs, live, and most "*.taobao.com" hosts (including 2.taobao.com).
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,taobao.com
# Classic Taobao CDNs. Widely listed by v2fly, Sukka, and ACL4SSR. Official open-platform article
# 120157 is cited as naming taobaocdn.com / tbcdn.cn, but the article body was not retrievable (portal shell).
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,taobaocdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tbcdn.cn
# Ali CDN scheduling / cache hostname used with Taobao properties. Also serves other Alibaba CDN traffic.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tbcache.com

# ----- Tmall -----
# Official Alipay service agreement names tmall.com as Tmall.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tmall.com
# Tmall international storefront linked from www.taobao.com and www.tmall.com on 2026-11-23.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tmall.hk

# ----- Xianyu / Goofish -----
# Official Alipay service agreement and Xianyu privacy policy define the Xianyu community domain as goofish.com.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,goofish.com
# Keyboard-looking domains and xianyu.mobi from blackmatrix7 XianYu.list are not adopted; see CHINA-REVIEW.md.

# ----- Shared dependencies -----
# The following also serve other Alibaba or Tencent products. Included because they are referenced by
# the in-scope services (pages and/or consistent community/official lists). Impact is broader than
# WeChat / Alipay / Taobao / Tmall / Xianyu alone.

# Alibaba CDN used by Taobao, Tmall, Goofish, and the Alipay homepage (img.alicdn.com) on 2026-11-23.
# Also serves other Alibaba apps. Do not expand to aliyuncs.com, aliyun.com, or Aliyun ASNs.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,alicdn.com
# Alibaba analytics / telemetry (gm/log/res.mmstat.com observed on Taobao, Tmall, and Goofish homepages).
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mmstat.com
# Advertising hosts observed in Taobao and Tmall homepage HTML on 2026-11-23.
# Not expanded to all of tanx.com; only these two baseline hosts are enabled.
DOMAIN,dfhs.tanx.com
DOMAIN,ecpm.tanx.com
# Official Cainiao domains. Xianyu privacy policy (fetched 2026-11-23) states delivery data is shared
# with Zhejiang Cainiao Supply Chain for fulfillment. Community lists include these for Taobao logistics.
# This is company/platform attribution plus a data-sharing statement, not a client packet capture.
# Also serves the Cainiao app and other merchants' logistics. Do not expand to all Alibaba logistics brands.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cainiao.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cainiao.com.cn

# ----- IP CIDRs (client destinations only; no-resolve) -----
# None adopted in this revision.
# WeChat long-connection / VoIP may use raw IPs; community DOMAIN-KEYWORD prefixes, ASN 132203,
# WeCom allowlists, 2022 face-pay terminal IPs, and broad Tencent/Alibaba clouds were all rejected.
# Candidates and reasons: CHINA-REVIEW.md.
